#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# expand_denominator

#% text
# `expand_denominator(e)` expands the denominators of all fractions in `e`, leaving the numerators alone.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
expand_denominator((x - 1)*((x - 2)/((x - 3)*(x - 4))))
#% output
#= (-2 + x)*(-1 + x)/(12 - 7*x + x^2)

#% cell
expand_denominator((x - y)^2/(u - v)^2)
#% output
#= (x - y)^2/(-2*u*v + u^2 + v^2)

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `expand_numerator`, `expand_all`, `expand`
